Cell["\<\
Experimental types are accessed by loading a subpackage, e.g., \
Needs[\"GWPTools`GWPEngine2D`\"], that registers the additional type and its \
properties within the GWPTools framework. \
\>", "Notes",
 CellChangeTimes->{
